    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーん……さっきの選手、
パンチはいいけど
蹴りがなってなかったわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... That last challenger
had a good punch, but their
kicks weren't up to scratch.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>スキだらけ。
そこを魔物にまで
つけ込まれててダメだわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Stance was full of openings.
So much so, even monsters
could tell and take advantage.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
