      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今、出てる選手は、
攻撃の鋭さは際立ってるけど
ガードが甘いわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This challenger now has
stunningly effective offense,
but is weak on defense.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのままじゃ、
撃ち負けるわよ、きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You'll definitely get
defeated, fighting like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おらぁっ！
アッパー！　キック！
ロウ！　ニー！　エルボ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heyyy! Uppercut!
Kick! Low!
High! Elbow!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うぉおおっ！
なんかオレの体も
勝手に動いてきちゃうぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoaa! Now my
body's starting to
move all on its own!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そらっっ！！
チャンスだっ！！
死ねっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's it! That's
your chance!
Kill'em good!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あああ……
はずしたよ……
何やってだか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahhh... How
could you
miss that...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　うるさい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? I'm too loud?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あああっ、死んじゃうっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeaaah! Diiieee!</EnglishText>
